{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10156","headline":"元日无衣冠入朝寄皇甫拾遗冉从弟补阙纾 · 李嘉佑","name":"元日无衣冠入朝寄皇甫拾遗冉从弟补阙纾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏奏随廉使，周行外冗员。\n白髭空受岁，丹陛不朝天。\n秉烛千官去，垂帘一室眠。\n羡君青琐里，并冕入炉烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}